  ('31fc120b-1d5c-425a-9856-4aef60b307bc'::uuid, 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000308'::uuid, 'OH', 'commercial', '99341', 'modifier_required', '{"answer":"The manual names NO service-specific modifier for home-based E/M, advance care planning, prolonged services, transitional care management or chronic care management (the only code-specific modifier anywhere in it is modifier 33 with H1000 for the obstetric e-PRAF, which does not apply to this practice). The general requirement is that claims carry HIPAA-compliant CPT/HCPCS codes with modifiers appended whenever a modifier is applicable; local or proprietary codes are not allowed. Do not read this manual as waiving modifiers - apply standard CPT/HCPCS modifier rules to 99341-99350, 99497/99498, 99417/G0318, 99495/99496 and 99490/99439/99491/99424-99427.","appliesToService":"All claims must include HIPAA-compliant CPT or HCPCS code(s) and modifiers","mappedFrom":"service-level rule mapped to this code"}'::jsonb, 'unknown', 0.80, DATE '2026-01-01', NULL, 'f85ab415-9c8e-4dab-a085-35ba7a0a620d'::uuid, 'HIPAA-compliant Current Procedural Terminology (CPT) or Healthcare Common Procedure Coding System (HCPCS) code(s) and modifiers when modifiers are applicable', 'extract:denial-rules-2026-08'),
