  ('5f3db7d0-62cd-499f-9864-a097f01faa34'::uuid, 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000104'::uuid, 'NC', 'medicaid_mco', '99417', 'bundled_with', '{"answer":"Prolonged-service and additional-time add-on codes are payable only with their base code on the claim: 99417/G0318 require the base home-visit E/M (99345 or 99350) on the same claim; 99439 requires 99490; 99425 requires 99424; 99427 requires 99426. If the base code is denied for any reason, CCH will also deny the add-on. Conversely, do not bill the base code with a quantity greater than one to represent extra time - use the add-on code, or the edit fires.","appliesToService":"\"claims where the add-on CPT code was billed without the primary service CPT code or if the primary service code was denied\" (Add-on and Base Code Edits)","mappedFrom":"service-level rule mapped to this code"}'::jsonb, 'varies', 0.80, DATE '2026-01-01', NULL, 'cbcc54f3-216e-40c7-acaf-e9c78656782f'::uuid, 'Rules look for claims where the add-on CPT code was billed without the primary service CPT code or if the primary service code was denied, then the add-on code is also denied.', 'extract:denial-rules-2026-08'),
