  ('28094d14-748a-40bf-82c0-fb572a5eab55'::uuid, 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000203'::uuid, 'SC', 'medicaid_mco', 'T1031', 'prior_auth_required', '{"answer":"All home health care requires prior authorization from the Utilization Management department BEFORE the service is delivered (call 866-757-8286 / fax 803-870-6500). This applies to the home health agency codes the manual lists (36415, S9128, S9129, S9131, T1021, T1028, T1030, T1031). IMPORTANT SCOPE LIMIT: do NOT apply this PA rule to physician/NP home visit E/M codes 99341-99350, to advance care planning 99497/99498, or to the home health certification/supervision codes G0179/G0180/G0181 - the manual attaches this requirement only to the listed home health agency codes.","appliesToService":"\"home health services\" / \"home health care\" as billed under the Home Health Care Billing section - i.e. the home health agency codes the manual itself names (skilled nursing, home health aide, therapy visits in the home). This is NOT the physician or NP home visit E/M benefit.","mappedFrom":"service-level rule mapped to this code"}'::jsonb, 'covered', 0.80, DATE '2026-01-01', NULL, '05460b0d-4e8b-4d5f-a991-ce1a69654967'::uuid, 'We require PA for all home health care. Contact our UM department for authorization prior to delivery of the service.', 'extract:denial-rules-2026-08'),
  ('b2bbe18e-f61f-47cb-b32e-1cf90ebcbbbd'::uuid, 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000203'::uuid, 'SC', 'medicaid_mco', '36415', 'units_per_period_max', '{"answer":"Home health services are capped at 50 visits per benefit year, counted across the codes 36415, S9128, S9129, S9131, T1021, T1028, T1030 and T1031. Track the member''s running visit count; visits beyond 50 in a benefit year deny unless Healthy Blue approves an exception (the manual notes it \"may approve services and benefits exceeding the limitations listed in this Medical Services Benefits Matrix\" case-by-case). Personal care services are excluded from the benefit entirely. SCOPE LIMIT: this 50-visit cap runs against the home health agency codes listed - it does NOT cap physician/NP home visit E/M 99341-99350.","appliesToService":"\"home health services\" - the benefit matrix states the same cap: \"Home health services / Limitations: 50 visits per benefit year / Personal care services excluded\". Services listed are intermittent skilled nursing, home health aide services, physical/occupational/speech therapy in the home, and physician-ordered supplies.","mappedFrom":"service-level rule mapped to this code"}'::jsonb, 'covered', 0.80, DATE '2026-01-01', NULL, '05460b0d-4e8b-4d5f-a991-ce1a69654967'::uuid, 'Members have a 50-visit limit per benefit year for home health services with the following codes: 36415, S9128, S9129, S9131, T1021, T1028, T1030 and T1031.', 'extract:denial-rules-2026-08'),
