  ('7e0656fe-9453-4468-818a-8800c94be66e'::uuid, 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000102'::uuid, 'NC', 'medicaid_mco', '99341', 'documentation_required', '{"answer":"A telehealth-delivered visit must be documented to the same standard as the equivalent in-person visit and must reflect what actually occurred, AND the note must explicitly state that the visit was conducted through audio-video telecommunications. Applies to any of these services delivered by telehealth: home visit E/M (99341-99350), ACP (99497, 99498), prolonged service (99417, G0318), TCM (99495, 99496). A note that omits the audio-video statement is an audit/denial exposure.","appliesToService":"A patient visit performed through Telehealth","mappedFrom":"service-level rule mapped to this code"}'::jsonb, 'covered', 0.80, DATE '2026-01-01', NULL, 'f55ff144-499c-48fe-8f66-f6e07b34ce32'::uuid, 'A patient visit performed through Telehealth should be documented to the same extent as an in-person visit, reflecting what occurred during the visit. The healthcare professionals should also document that the visit was done through audio-video telecommunications.', 'extract:denial-rules-2026-08'),
