  ('5b12cf89-7987-45d8-bf67-b0e72e483d5d'::uuid, 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000104'::uuid, 'NC', 'medicaid_mco', '99427', 'units_per_period_max', '{"answer":"Units on each claim line are capped by the CMS MUE for that code per patient per date of service; CCH applies MUEs from the CMS NCCI tables. This matters most for time-based add-ons billed in multiple units (99417, G0318, 99439, 99425, 99427) and for ACP (99498). Enter the quantity in Box 24G (a value of at least 1 is required); units beyond the MUE deny, and invalid units are also an EDI rejection (rejection code 75, ''Invalid units of service'').","appliesToService":"\"Medically Unlikely Edits (MUEs) for Practitioners, DME Providers and Facilities\" - \"the maximum number of units that a provider would bill for a single enrollee, on a single date of service\"","mappedFrom":"service-level rule mapped to this code"}'::jsonb, 'varies', 0.80, DATE '2026-01-01', NULL, 'cbcc54f3-216e-40c7-acaf-e9c78656782f'::uuid, 'MUE’s reflect the maximum number of units that a provider would bill for a single enrollee, on a single date of service.', 'extract:denial-rules-2026-08'),
  ('c8a2066b-9c19-42ab-ab7b-a4808ab0dd2c'::uuid, 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000104'::uuid, 'NC', 'medicaid_mco', 'G0179', 'pos_allowed', '{"answer":"Place of service is a Required field on every line of the CMS-1500: enter the correct 2-digit CMS standard POS code (for home-based palliative care this is normally 12 Home, or 13/14/32/33 for assisted living, group home and nursing facility settings, per the CMS POS list this manual points to). This manual does not enumerate which POS codes CCH permits for any specific code, so validate against the CMS list. A missing or invalid POS is one of CCH''s listed common causes of claims processing delays and denials.","appliesToService":"Field 24 B (unshaded) of the CMS-1500, \"PLACE OF SERVICE\" - a Required (R) field on every professional claim line","mappedFrom":"service-level rule mapped to this code"}'::jsonb, 'unknown', 0.80, DATE '2026-01-01', NULL, 'cbcc54f3-216e-40c7-acaf-e9c78656782f'::uuid, 'Enter the appropriate 2-digit CMS Standard Place of Service (POS) Code.', 'extract:denial-rules-2026-08'),
  ('6fcdef97-005f-49c7-85db-90316b8d87f5'::uuid, 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000104'::uuid, 'NC', 'medicaid_mco', 'G0180', 'pos_allowed', '{"answer":"Place of service is a Required field on every line of the CMS-1500: enter the correct 2-digit CMS standard POS code (for home-based palliative care this is normally 12 Home, or 13/14/32/33 for assisted living, group home and nursing facility settings, per the CMS POS list this manual points to). This manual does not enumerate which POS codes CCH permits for any specific code, so validate against the CMS list. A missing or invalid POS is one of CCH''s listed common causes of claims processing delays and denials.","appliesToService":"Field 24 B (unshaded) of the CMS-1500, \"PLACE OF SERVICE\" - a Required (R) field on every professional claim line","mappedFrom":"service-level rule mapped to this code"}'::jsonb, 'unknown', 0.80, DATE '2026-01-01', NULL, 'cbcc54f3-216e-40c7-acaf-e9c78656782f'::uuid, 'Enter the appropriate 2-digit CMS Standard Place of Service (POS) Code.', 'extract:denial-rules-2026-08'),
  ('c5db0d3c-c4f4-4856-9822-7af90be20fed'::uuid, 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000104'::uuid, 'NC', 'medicaid_mco', 'G0181', 'pos_allowed', '{"answer":"Place of service is a Required field on every line of the CMS-1500: enter the correct 2-digit CMS standard POS code (for home-based palliative care this is normally 12 Home, or 13/14/32/33 for assisted living, group home and nursing facility settings, per the CMS POS list this manual points to). This manual does not enumerate which POS codes CCH permits for any specific code, so validate against the CMS list. A missing or invalid POS is one of CCH''s listed common causes of claims processing delays and denials.","appliesToService":"Field 24 B (unshaded) of the CMS-1500, \"PLACE OF SERVICE\" - a Required (R) field on every professional claim line","mappedFrom":"service-level rule mapped to this code"}'::jsonb, 'unknown', 0.80, DATE '2026-01-01', NULL, 'cbcc54f3-216e-40c7-acaf-e9c78656782f'::uuid, 'Enter the appropriate 2-digit CMS Standard Place of Service (POS) Code.', 'extract:denial-rules-2026-08'),
  ('ee8a5ec0-d765-40a8-a103-46f19518bdcb'::uuid, 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000104'::uuid, 'NC', 'medicaid_mco', '99497', 'modifier_required', '{"answer":"Only one CPT/HCPCS code and up to four modifiers per claim line, and only the FIRST modifier is used to price the line - so the pricing modifier (e.g. 25 on a home-visit E/M, or 59/X{EPSU}) must be in the first position, ahead of informational modifiers. Wrong modifier position, an invalid modifier/code combination, or a code not valid for the date of service will get the line rejected, denied or paid incorrectly.","appliesToService":"Field 24 D (unshaded) of the CMS-1500, \"PROCEDURES, SERVICES OR SUPPLIES CPT/HCPCS MODIFIER\"","mappedFrom":"service-level rule mapped to this code"}'::jsonb, 'varies', 0.80, DATE '2026-01-01', NULL, 'cbcc54f3-216e-40c7-acaf-e9c78656782f'::uuid, 'Only the first modifier entered is used for pricing the claim. Failure to use modifiers in the correct position or combination with the Procedure Code, or invalid use of modifiers, will result in a rejected, denied, or incorrectly paid claim.', 'extract:denial-rules-2026-08'),
  ('431df51d-b937-43c4-9a21-cd81210ff70f'::uuid, 'a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000104'::uuid, 'NC', 'medicaid_mco', '99498', 'modifier_required', '{"answer":"Only one CPT/HCPCS code and up to four modifiers per claim line, and only the FIRST modifier is used to price the line - so the pricing modifier (e.g. 25 on a home-visit E/M, or 59/X{EPSU}) must be in the first position, ahead of informational modifiers. Wrong modifier position, an invalid modifier/code combination, or a code not valid for the date of service will get the line rejected, denied or paid incorrectly.","appliesToService":"Field 24 D (unshaded) of the CMS-1500, \"PROCEDURES, SERVICES OR SUPPLIES CPT/HCPCS MODIFIER\"","mappedFrom":"service-level rule mapped to this code"}'::jsonb, 'varies', 0.80, DATE '2026-01-01', NULL, 'cbcc54f3-216e-40c7-acaf-e9c78656782f'::uuid, 'Only the first modifier entered is used for pricing the claim. Failure to use modifiers in the correct position or combination with the Procedure Code, or invalid use of modifiers, will result in a rejected, denied, or incorrectly paid claim.', 'extract:denial-rules-2026-08'),
